        "source_formula": "\\[\\begin{align*}\n  \\bar{x}\\pm 1.96 \\sqrt{\\frac{\\bar{x}(1-\\bar{x})}{n}}=0.6\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{0.6(1-0.6)}{10}}=0.6\\pm 0.3036=(0.2964, 0.9036)\n\\end{align*}\\]"
